Error [jet.DistinctArithmeticNotAllowed]: This implicit unit conversion would round
  --> tests/ui/quantity_implicit_rounding.jet:7:10
    |
  7 |     bad: 1meter + 1thirdish
    |          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The exact scale or offset cannot be represented as an integer conversion at this boundary
 Fix: Write `Thirdish.from_meter_rounded(expr, .NearestEven, digits: 0) ?? fallback` (the rounded conversion returns a Result) or choose another rounding policy
